{"id":"f1736212b369c916","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-power-object.md","title":"幂对象与关系分类","display":"df-power-object — 幂对象与关系分类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-power-object","aliases":["16-df-power-object","Power object"],"display":"df-power-object — 幂对象与关系分类","depends_on":["[[16-df-finite-limits]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"source":"Theorem 5.5.1 pp.346–347 (PDF366–367); Notation 5.4.3 p.341 (PDF361)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-power-object"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-power-object</span><span>Power object</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-power-object — 幂对象与关系分类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Theorem 5.5.1 pp.346–347 (PDF366–367); Notation 5.4.3 p.341 (PDF361)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinProd}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinProd}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>。</li>\n<li>在有限积存在的合取分支中固定积及投影。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PowerObj}_{\\mathcal E}(I;P,M,\\epsilon)\">\\(\\mathrm{PowerObj}_{\\mathcal E}(I;P,M,\\epsilon)\\)</span> 的参数域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,P,M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\">\\(I,P,M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(M,P\\times I)\">\\(\\epsilon\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(M,P\\times I)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\times\\operatorname{id}_I\">\\(r\\times\\operatorname{id}_I\\)</span> 由积泛性质诱导。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PowObjAll}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\mathrm{PowObjAll}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> 为下文定义的性质；其中有限积选择固定后再量化各对象的候选幂对象数据。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PowerObj}_{\\mathcal E}(I;P,M,\\epsilon)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}(\\epsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall J,R\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(R,J\\times I))\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}(m)\\Rightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(\\exists!r\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(J,P))\n(\\exists k\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(R,M))\\\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(m,k;r\\times\\operatorname{id}_I,\\epsilon)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{PowObjAll}(\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\exists P,M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\exists\\epsilon\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(M,P\\times I))\\\n\\mathrm{PowerObj}_{\\mathcal E}(I;P,M,\\epsilon).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PowerObj}_{\\mathcal E}(I;P,M,\\epsilon)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}(\\epsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall J,R\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(R,J\\times I))\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}(m)\\Rightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(\\exists!r\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(J,P))\n(\\exists k\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(R,M))\\\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(m,k;r\\times\\operatorname{id}_I,\\epsilon)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{PowObjAll}(\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\exists P,M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\exists\\epsilon\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(M,P\\times I))\\\n\\mathrm{PowerObj}_{\\mathcal E}(I;P,M,\\epsilon).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon:M\\rightarrowtail P\\times I\">\\(\\epsilon:M\\rightarrowtail P\\times I\\)</span> 是泛成员关系，每个关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:R\\rightarrowtail J\\times I\">\\(m:R\\rightarrowtail J\\times I\\)</span> 有唯一关系分类箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:J\\to P\">\\(r:J\\to P\\)</span>。在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 单态而唯一。定义只用同一本书已有的积、单态与拉回，没有用名称“表示子对象函子”代替实际泛性质。</p>\n<p>同构的关系单态有相同分类箭头，故泛性质下降到子对象同构类，并给出自然双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E(J,P)\\cong\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(J\\times I)\">\\(\\mathcal E(J,P)\\cong\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(J\\times I)\\)</span>。不同积的选择由规范同构运输，因而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PowObjAll}\">\\(\\mathrm{PowObjAll}\\)</span> 不依赖选择。在初等拓扑斯中可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\Omega^I\">\\(P=\\Omega^I\\)</span>，将评价箭头的真值拉回作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为范畴，$\\mathrm{FinProd}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]，$\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}$、$\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为范畴，$\\mathrm{FinProd}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]，$\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}$、$\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinProd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PowerObj}_{\\mathcal E}(I;P,M,\\epsilon)","display":false},{"tex":"I,P,M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(M,P\\times I)","display":false},{"tex":"r\\times\\operatorname{id}_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PowObjAll}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PowerObj}_{\\mathcal E}(I;P,M,\\epsilon)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}(\\epsilon)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall J,R\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(R,J\\times I))\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}(m)\\Rightarrow\\\\\n&\\qquad(\\exists!r\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(J,P))\n(\\exists k\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(R,M))\\\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(m,k;r\\times\\operatorname{id}_I,\\epsilon)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{PowObjAll}(\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\exists P,M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\exists\\epsilon\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(M,P\\times I))\\\n\\mathrm{PowerObj}_{\\mathcal E}(I;P,M,\\epsilon).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\epsilon:M\\rightarrowtail P\\times I","display":false},{"tex":"m:R\\rightarrowtail J\\times I","display":false},{"tex":"r:J\\to P","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E(J,P)\\cong\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(J\\times I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PowObjAll}","display":false},{"tex":"P=\\Omega^I","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false}],"bytes":2545,"backlinks":[{"id":"ba3b191d87bb028c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 具有指定有限极限。$D=(\\mathcal E,I,P,M,\\epsilon)$ 满足 $\\mathrm{PowerObj}_{\\mathcal E}(I;P,M,\\epsilon)$，采用 [[16-df-power-object]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-120","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-display-map-category]]、[[16-df-relatively-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-dependent-product]]、[[16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint]]、[[16-df-power-object]]、[[16-df-singleton-map]]、[[16-lem-singleton-monic]]、[[16-thm-power-object]]。最小伴随存在性与完整含BC的理解积分别保留；singleton单态性用任意广义元素证明。"},{"id":"da4a5dccfe412249","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为范畴。$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}$ 采用 [[16-df-elementary-topos]]，$\\mathrm{FinLim}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]，$\\mathrm{PowObjAll}$ 采用 [[16-df-power-object]]。"}],"outgoing":["b75e7c168ac56b22","dacf0503b95c88a9"]}